------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. ORIGIN & HISTORY / ORIGEN E HISTORIAL
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

EN: Glob Defenders (GlD) was created in May 2026. However, the Pyces and Globs
    themselves have existed since roughly 2023, and have been continuously
    redrawn and remodeled up to their current form. Resources from the ROBLOX
    games "Find the Pyces" (2) and "Find Those Pyces" (1) are reused frequently.

    Most of the game's resources (Globs, Monsters, Bits/Bytes and more) come
    from "Iniciation Defenses" (I.D.). Any I.D. resource is property of the
    group that developed it; however, POPLIO_30 granted KirByte_Bi the freedom
    to use them for Glob Defenders. Therefore, any I.D. resources that do not
    carry their own credits are also property of KirByte_Bi. The Monsters
    remain attributed to POP (POPLIO_30).

ES: Glob Defenders (GlD) se creó en mayo de 2026. Sin embargo, los Pyces y los
    Globs existen desde aproximadamente 2023, y han sido redibujados y
    remodelados continuamente hasta su forma actual. Se reutilizan con
    frecuencia recursos de los juegos de ROBLOX "Find the Pyces" (2) y
    "Find Those Pyces" (1).

    La mayoría de los recursos del juego (Globs, Monsters, Bits/Bytes y más)
    provienen de "Iniciation Defenses" (I.D.). Cualquier recurso de I.D. es
    propiedad del grupo que lo desarrolló; no obstante, POPLIO_30 dio a
    KirByte_Bi la libertad de usarlos para Glob Defenders. Por ello, los
    recursos de I.D. que no tienen créditos propios son también propiedad de
    KirByte_Bi. Los Monsters siguen atribuidos a POP (POPLIO_30).

