5. THIRD-PARTY REFERENCES / REFERENCIAS DE TERCEROS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

EN: Some cosmetics are original artwork that merely takes inspiration from or
    references the following properties. All trademarks and copyrights belong
    to their respective owners; no affiliation or endorsement is implied.

ES: Algunos cosméticos son arte original que únicamente se inspira en o hace
    referencia a las siguientes propiedades. Todas las marcas y derechos
    pertenecen a sus respectivos dueños; no implica afiliación ni respaldo.

  - Pinkbot Reskin        — inspired by Kirby (© HAL Laboratory / Nintendo)
  - Silent Habitant Reskin — Waddle Dee reference (© HAL Laboratory)
  - Cutely Haired         — inspired by Hatsune Miku (© Crypton Future Media, Inc.)
  - Lovely Haired         — inspired by Kasane Teto (© AHS Co., Ltd.)
  - The Watcher           — inspired by Yo-kai Watch (© LEVEL-5 Inc.)
  - Monobear Bombot Reskin — Danganronpa reference
  - Bunnity Bombot Reskin  — Danganronpa reference
  - Glamour Hat           — a subtle nod to Cappy from Super Mario Odyssey
  - Furnace Bombot        — a reference to Tower Heroes (Hiloh / Tower Heroes, ROBLOX)
  - Clockwork Bombot      — original design; loosely mixes inspiration from
                            Tower Heroes (ROBLOX) and Super Mario 64. Being a
                            clock or a furnace does not tie it to anything by
                            itself.

